# Playbook Design Tokens

Source of truth: `backstage/design/source/colors_and_type.css` and `frontend/src/app/globals.css`.

## Color

| Token | Value | Use |
|-------|-------|-----|
| `brand` | `#FF7300` | Primary action, active state, Playbook mark accent |
| `brand-hover` | `#FF8224` | Hover state |
| `brand-press` | `#E85F00` | Pressed state |
| `brand-soft` | `rgba(255,115,0,0.14)` | Subtle active fills |
| `bg-void` | `#0C0B09` | Deep shell |
| `bg-page` | `#100F0C` | Full page |
| `bg-base` | `#16140F` | App workspace |
| `surface` | `#1C1A14` | Default surface |
| `surface-raised` | `#221F18` | Cards, dialogs |
| `surface-hover` | `#2A271E` | Hover surface |
| `fg-1` | `#F6F1E8` | Primary text |
| `fg-2` | `#C2B9A8` | Secondary text |
| `fg-3` | `#8E8674` | Muted text |
| `fg-4` | `#5A5343` | Placeholder/faint |
| `info` | `#4FB6C7` | Teal info, thinking state |
| `success` | `#3FB68B` | Ready/success |
| `warning` | `#F4A93C` | Warning |
| `danger` | `#F0563F` | Failure/destructive |

Use warm charcoal neutrals. Do not introduce blue-gray surfaces or blue/purple AI gradients.

## Type

- `--font-display`: Archivo, for brand/display headings.
- `--font-display-alt`: Sora, alternate geometric display.
- `--font-body`: Inter, body and UI labels.
- `--font-mono`: Inter in product UI.

Load fonts with `next/font/local`; do not fetch web fonts at runtime.

## Shape And Motion

- Controls: `rounded-md` / 8px.
- Cards and dialogs: `rounded-lg` / 12px.
- Pills: `rounded-pill`.
- Focus: `shadow-focus` and `border-brand`.
- Motion uses `120ms`, `200ms`, `360ms` and must honor `prefers-reduced-motion`.

## Rules

- Tokens live in Tailwind v4 `@theme` in `frontend/src/app/globals.css`.
- Prefer token-backed utilities. Add named tokens for repeated exact design dimensions.
- Inline SVG is allowed only for the Playbook mark and Microsoft/Google SSO logos.
